; Rocksmith.ini — RealtoneWine reference settings
; Location: steamapps/common/Rocksmith2014/Rocksmith.ini
; Only these keys matter for the cable path; keep the rest of your file as-is.

[Audio]
ForceWDM=0
ExclusiveMode=0
DumpAudioLog=1

; Notes:
; - ForceWDM=0 is the supported configuration (it is also what the game
;   effectively runs on Windows 11, where the WDM-KS audio stack is no
;   longer reachable by user-mode code).
; - ExclusiveMode=1 also works: our Wine patch serves exclusive clients as
;   shared, matching Windows behavior.
; - DumpAudioLog=1 writes audiodump.txt next to this file while the game
;   runs — the first place to look when reporting issues.
; - LatencyBuffer=4 is the game default.
